 "notes": "CardDemo's view-transaction screen (transaction CT01, program COTRN01C): entered from the transaction list with a selected transaction it reads it and shows every field (the amount through an edited picture); ENTER looks one up, PF3 returns, PF4 clears, PF5 goes to the list. The TRANSACT file is loaded from CardDemo's own dailytran.txt (the same 350-byte layout, CVTRA05Y / CVTRA06Y, that POSTTRAN posts into it). Derived from CardDemo (Apache-2.0; Copyright Amazon.com, Inc. or its affiliates): LICENSE and NOTICE here are the source's own."
